# Generated by scripts/conformance/generate_collation_vectors.py; do not edit by hand.
# The collation vectors (milestone SJL-17.2), options.vectors: the four options: sensitivity, ignorePunctuation, numeric and caseFirst, by option, by keyword and through localeCompare.
